# Delivered files that Windows itself parses.
#
# `启动 ResearchPage.cmd` is read line by line by cmd.exe, which mis-parses a
# batch file whose lines end in LF (it chops them mid-line and then runs the
# fragments: «'m' 不是内部或外部命令»), so this file must arrive with CRLF no
# matter how it was obtained — clone, checkout with autocrlf=false, or a
# downloaded archive.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
